* TOPX -- tsu BBS topics list. Model 4 (43x80).
*
* Read-only port of the tsu topic.go topicsList screen. Field-name
* contract shared with the other model so the same topx.cob drives
* either terminal. Per-topic rows carry a 1-byte selector INPUT at
* col 0 plus six display columns at the exact tsu go3270 columns
* (attribute byte at the declared col, text one to the right --
* identical to go3270, so positions transfer 1:1).
*
* Deviations from tsu (all forced by bricks):
*   - separator is 78 asterisks, not 79 (col 79 stays untouched to
*     dodge the wrap-to-next-row bug; see bookm2.map)
*   - F11 point-and-sort, F5=Add Topic and per-column sort markers
*     dropped (read-only browser, F10 toggle only)
*   - tsu's 'Found: n' overlay at search col 31 collides with the
*     STOP byte; folded into ERRMSG instead
*
* Colors (verbatim from topic.go):
*   title row BRIGHT default, page no BRIGHT YELLOW, headers BRIGHT
*   GREEN (Created BRIGHT YELLOW), separator BLUE, titles WHITE
*   with per-row TITnn-C override from topics.color, authors RED,
*   posts DEFAULT, views TURQUOISE, likes PINK, dates BLUE.
MAP TOPL4 SIZE 43x80
  FIELD LTITLE AT 0,0   LEN 58 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=DEFAULT
  FIELD LPAGE  AT 0,60  LEN 9  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD HDRS   AT 1,0   LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "S"
  FIELD HDRT   AT 1,2   LEN 11 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "Topic Title"
  FIELD HDRA   AT 1,44  LEN 6  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "Author"
  FIELD HDRP   AT 1,53  LEN 5  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "Posts"
  FIELD HDRV   AT 1,59  LEN 5  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "Views"
  FIELD HDRL   AT 1,65  LEN 5  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN  "Likes"
  FIELD HDRD   AT 1,71  LEN 7  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW "Created"
  FIELD SEPLN  AT 2,0   LEN 78 PROT COLOR=BLUE "******************************************************************************"
  INPUT SEL01  AT 3,0  LEN 1  UNDERSCORE
  FIELD TIT01  AT 3,2  LEN 41 PROT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD AUT01  AT 3,44 LEN 7  PROT COLOR=RED
  FIELD PST01  AT 3,53 LEN 5  PROT COLOR=DEFAULT
  FIELD VWS01  AT 3,59 LEN 5  PROT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD LIK01  AT 3,65 LEN 5  PROT COLOR=PINK
